# City format

Event `city` values must be **`City, XX`** with a **2–3 letter uppercase** region or country code.

- US/Canada: state/province — `Denver, CO`, `Toronto, ON`
- Elsewhere: ISO-style country code — `Sydney, AU`, `Paris, FR`, `London, UK`, `Prague, CZ`

Never write full country or region names (`Sydney, Australia`, `Paris, France`, `Berlin, Germany`).

The DB enforces this (`events_city_canonical_format`). UI uses `isCanonicalCityLabel` / city suggestions from `cityPlaces.ts`. When bulk-inserting events, always use initials — do not invent spelled-out countries.
